in writing \"Silver Streak\", and this time he's much more successful ."}, "D7S8": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06", "start": 552, "end": 553, "text": "."}, "D7S9": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06", "start": 554, "end": 555, "text": "."}, "D7S10": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06", "start": 556, "end": 566, "text": "Still, Mr."}, "D8S1": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d07", "start": 0, "end": 105, "text": "a cocktail laced with Spanish Fly and dances while removing nearly all his clothing to a Bee Gees album ."}, "D8S2": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d07", "start": 106, "end": 280, "text": "Shocked by his misunderstanding , Gloria flees and returns to her apartment , where she is attacked by a man with a scar who demands the cigarette pack Scotty had given her ."}, "D8S3": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d07", "start": 281, "end": 415, "text": "When he attempts to strangle her with a scarf , Gloria stabs him in the stomach with a pair of knitting needles and calls the police ."}, "D8S4": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d07", "start": 416, "end": 514, "text": "When the attacker tries to stop her , he is killed by a knife thrown by Whitey through the kitchen"}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d00:c0", "entity": "Foul Play", "scope": "album", "claim": "The genre of \"Foul Play\" is reggae.", "answer": "reggae", "quote": "Foul Play (album) Foul Play is a 1981 album by reggae singer Dennis Brown, the first of three albums to be released as part of his international record deal with A&M.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d03", "card_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d03:c0", "entity": "Foul Play", "scope": "album", "claim": "The genre of the album \"Foul Play\" 